No, this is canonical behaviour of the Y2K bug in versions of NH prior
to 3.2.3 (and in SLASH); the longer-than-expected year (103 in a YY
field) causes the date to overwrite the role field in the recordfile
entry, hence confusion. The OP would be advised to upgrade to a
current version of SLASH'EM if he doesn't want to fix the bug in his
own copy.

(And Elves weren't removed in SLASH anyway; races were only added in
3.3.0, and SLASH'EM 0.0.5E8.)

